
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This directory contains the pointing history, efficiency function and list of
detected objects for the L3h block of CFEPS, the only CFEPS block observed in
the MegaPrime r filter. The g-band blocks are in CFEPS_g.

The content of this directory is:

CFEPS_r
   \---------- README.cfeps_r (this file) Describes the content of the directory
    \--------- pointings.list           Pointing and time of the L3h block
     \-------- L3h-smooth.eff           Efficiency function for block L3h
      \------- CFEPS_r.detections       List of objects really detected in
                                        L3h, with their dynamical class if
                                        known, magnitude at detection, rate of
                                        motion, H mag, and more.

See CFEPS_g/README.formats for the format of a survey "block".

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
